My Pregnancy is a week-by-week pregnancy tracker. Our app will help you over the course of your pregnancy. Stay on top of the changes happening inside your body. Find out how your baby is developing.

Our app is completely free and does not contain advertising.

This app includes:
- week-by-week advice;
- useful information on fetal development and changes in your body;
- week-by-week fetal measurements and imaging;
- a to-do list for each trimester;
- a list of things you will need for hospital check-in, post-natal care and check-out;
- a weight tracker you can use to follow weight gain;
- a kick counter;
- a contraction timer;
- and much more

We have created this app with love, specially for young mothers.

This app is not intended for medical use and is not a substitute for medical consultation.

If you have any questions or requests, please write to neumandev@gmail.com. We are eager to hear your comments on how to improve the app.

Pills Time is a personal pharmacy assistant and one of the most convenient medication reminders. You won't forget to take your medicine – our pill reminder will send you a notification! Now improve your health and quickly defeat any disease is much easier.

Make your medication schedule in accordance with the instructions or recipe given to you by your doctor. Flexible configuration will help you to defer or postpone a regular pill intake. Your courses will be archived, so you can return to them as needed!

Our advantages:
- The schedule for the day, week, month;
- Courses by number of medications;
- Taking medicine daily, every few days, weeks, months;
- Any duration and repetition rates;
- Automatic calculation of the remaining medicine;
- The opportunity to save the current medication;
- History of medication doses directly in the calendar.
- Your own database of medicines, pills and vitamins.

Take care of your health – and Pills Time will help you with this!

A porta de acesso aos serviços do Sistema Único de Saúde (SUS) de forma digital está de cara nova! O antigo "Conecte SUS" agora é Meu SUS Digital.  O aplicativo permite que o cidadão acompanhe, na palma da mão, o seu histórico clínico e acesse diversas soluções para que ele seja o protagonista da sua saúde. É um compromisso contínuo do Governo Federal e do Ministério da Saúde em aprimorar a experiência do usuário e fortalecer o SUS!

- Acesse as suas interações nos pontos de atenção à saúde e acompanhar históricos de exames, vacinas, medicamentos e muito mais; 
- Emita documentos e certificados, como a autorização de retirada de absorventes,  Certificado de Vacinação, Certificado Internacional de Vacinação ou Profilaxia (CIVP);   
- Habilite ou desabilite a adesão ao programa do Farmácia Popular;  
- Acompanhe a sua posição na fila do Sistema Nacional de Transplantes;
- Localize serviços de saúde próximos a você, como Saúde Bucal e tratamento de Doenças Raras; 
- Gerencie a sua saúde pessoal pelo Meu Diário de Saúde;  
- Acompanhe notícias seguras e confiáveis sobre saúde e bem-estar.  
Para acessar o aplicativo é necessário apenas possuir uma conta no Gov.br!

Os registros de saúde no Meu SUS Digital são responsabilidade dos gestores estaduais e municipais de saúde. Os dados são coletados e enviados para a base de dados do Ministério da Saúde, integrados à Rede Nacional de Dados em Saúde (RNDS) e disponibilizados automaticamente no aplicativo.

Medication Reminder: Pill App is the perfect solution for anyone who has trouble keeping track of their medications. Whether you're taking one pill a day or multiple pills at different times, this app will help you stay on top of your medications and take them on time. With our pill reminder app with alarm, you'll never forget to take your pills again!

With our user-friendly interface, you can easily set up medication reminders and alerts. You can also track your medication history, create a medication list, and receive helpful reminders when it's time to refill your prescriptions. Our pill reminder alarm free app ensures that you'll always be reminded to take your pills, no matter where you are.

Features:

* There is no need to register or provide any personal information in order to use the app;
* Search medications using comprehensive database;
* Set medication alarm to mark, skip or snooze;
* Choose from various alarm melodies;
* Customize alarm melody with options;
* Determine medication frequency using dosage tracker;
* Pause therapy with option to resume;
* Group medications according to preference;
* Postpone reminders, set number of reminders and group by time;
* Track medication adherence history;
* Edit or delete individual medication entries and therapy periods;
* Run multiple reminders simultaneously;
* Display reminders in horizontal mode.

Our pill reminder and med tracker app is designed to help you take control of your health. It's a convenient way to keep track of all your medications and ensure that you're taking them as prescribed. You can even set up reminders for different members of your family or for different medications, using our Medication Reminder: Pill App.

In addition to our pill reminder app, we also offer a medication tracker and medication list app. With our medication tracker, you can keep track of your medication history, including the dosage, frequency, and any side effects you may be experiencing. Our medication list app makes it easy to keep track of all your medications in one place.

Our med reminder app with alarm is perfect for anyone who needs help remembering to take their medications. It's a great way to stay on top of your health and ensure that you're taking your medications as prescribed. With our med reminder app, you'll never miss a dose again.

Our medication app is also great for healthcare providers, caregivers, and anyone who works in the healthcare industry. You can use our meds reminder, meds tracker, and pill logger to help manage your patients' medications and ensure that they're taking them as prescribed.

Whether you're looking for a pill app reminder or a medication reminder, Medication Reminder: Pill App has everything you need to stay on top of your health. Download our app today and start taking control of your health!

